VED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "36446335488315097"}, "asset_files": {"count": 9}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8332853930089963", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "36170474735901175"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3336161029990352"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1780608796, "id": "36170474735901175", "version": "1.13.37", "version_code": 610, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "36170461309235851"}, "asset_files": {"count": 9}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "8332853930089963", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "36170474735901175"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3336161029990352"}]}, "change_log": "\u2728 What's New\n\n\ud83c\udf9a\ufe0f Added a Controller Deadzone dial in the Controller Options panel so you can fine-tune stick sensitivity and eliminate stick drift.\n\n\u2699\ufe0f Improvements\n\n\ud83c\udfaf Aiming is now more accurate, with the reticle using precise targeting so your shots land exactly where you point.\n\ud83c\udfc3 Hunter and Storm move faster, and Blink gains improved mobility.\n\ud83d\udcaa Goliath is now tougher with a health boost to suit its heavy playstyle.\n\u26a1 Prestige now scales your movement speed, rewarding high-level play.\n\u2744\ufe0f Improved snow effects and environmental visuals.\n\n\ud83d\udc1b Bug Fixes\n\n\ud83d\udc79 Bosses and mini-bosses (including Apex, Tentacron, Shellshock, Leviath and Blazejaw) no longer get defeated early before all their shields are destroyed.\n\ud83d\ude81 The extraction dropship no longer lands at the very start of the Tentacron fight.\n\ud83c\udfc6 Your campaign victory is now secured the moment you defeat the boss, so leaving before boarding the dropship no longer loses your progress.\n\ud83d\udd04 Fixed several New Game Plus issues, including accidental early access, progress banking, and saves getting stuck after restarting the campaign.\n\ud83d\udcbe Fixed saves becoming stuck in the hub and other orphaned-save problems.\n\ud83d\udeaa Walking into a closed dropship no longer drops you into a seat by mistake.\n\u2728 Fixed the final dropship teleport so the journey home plays correctly.\n\ud83e\ude83 Goliath-reflected projectiles no longer fly backwards after bouncing.\n\ud83c\udfa8 Blink's disc link no longer turns two colours when you change theme while holding a disc.\n\ud83e\udd1d Suit skills and prestige now correctly apply to your projectiles in multiplayer.\n\ud83d\udc55 Your chosen suit no longer leaks from the multiplayer suit picker into your solo save.\n\ud83d\udcf3 Button click haptics no longer get skipped after switching menu panels.\n\ud83e\uddf1 Fixed positioning of breakable floors and objects, including the soft block on the Apex pickup.\n\ud83d\udcd6 Resolved several story and narrative progression issues.\n\n\ud83d\udd27 Technical\n\n\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Updated to the latest Unity engine version for improved stability across all platforms.\n\ud83d\udce6 Streamlined asset loading and the build pipeline for better reliability and reduced memory use.", "created_date": 1780521557, "id": "36145210101760972", "version": "1.13.36", "version_code": 609, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "36145192345096081"}, "asset_files": {"count": 9}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "